# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# frame-ancestors is deliberately open: the embed's whole purpose is to be
# dropped into third-party pages, and an allowlist would need maintaining by
# whoever adds a new host. Narrow it to named origins if the set of embedding
# sites ever becomes known and small.
#
# Note there is no X-Frame-Options header here. Sending one would override
# frame-ancestors in older browsers and break the embed.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *;
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
